        <styleUrl>#style-BED</styleUrl>
        <Point>
          <coordinates>-106.311336,38.279995,0</coordinates>
        </Point>
      </Placemark>
      <Placemark>
        <name>F1-01 meadow 10019</name>
        <description>Feed on a southeast-facing bench at 10,019 ft, 40% canopy, 21% slope; 1.1 mi from the nearest motorized route, 0.28 mi to water, 0.7 mi to security timber T05 (835 ac). Photos (2021-11-16): open meadow against a dense timber edge. (score 0.993)</description>
        <styleUrl>#style-FEED</styleUrl>
        <Point>
          <coordinates>-106.330110,38.256263,0</coordinates>
        </Point>
      </Placemark>
      <Placemark>
        <name>F1-02 meadow 10229</name>
        <description>Feed on a southeast-facing knob at 10,229 ft, 34% canopy, 28% slope; 0.7 mi from the nearest motorized route, 0.20 mi to water, 0.5 mi to security timber T05 (835 ac). Photos (2018-11-09): weak feed: thin timber, not a meadow; small opening 100 m southeast (NAIP 2019). (score 0.976)</description>
        <styleUrl>#style-FEED</styleUrl>
        <Point>
          <coordinates>-106.342863,38.259902,0</coordinates>
        </Point>
      </Placemark>
